| `wordpress-pb-order-complete-signal.php` | **72** | PB Order complete signal (headless cart clear) |
| `wordpress-pb-headless-cart-sync.php` | 54 | Legacy cart sync — do not dual-enable with 64 |
| `wordpress-pb-shipping-quote.php` | (see SNIPPETS / list API) | |
| `wordpress-pb-reservedeler-items.php` | (see SNIPPETS / list API) | |
| Others | List via API if unsure | Prefer matching by snippet `name` |

If ID unknown: `GET …/snippets?per_page=100` and match by name.

## Do not

- Prefer mu-plugin install paths in new docs or snippet headers.
- Leave a critical snippet inactive after a failed deploy — rollback or fix immediately.
- Commit `.env.local` or print Application Passwords in chat.
